291
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,630
why Father refuses to let me cultivate !

292
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:19,510
I told you,

293
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,030
you're not suited for it.

294
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,110
30 years of wealth and honor...

295
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,830
Is that your compensation

296
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:29,160
for not letting me cultivate ?

297
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:31,950
Yes.

298
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,120
Father,

299
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:36,150
what is true wealth and honor ?

300
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:40,030
What kind of wealth and honor do you want ?

301
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:42,670
You once taught me

302
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:44,830
that a person should defy the heavens

303
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:47,190
and refuse to be crushed by the heavens and the earth.

304
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,150
Climb mountains when you encounter them,

305
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,550
cross rivers when you encounter them,

306
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,950
cross the seas when you encounter them.

307
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,560
Never give in

308
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,350
when facing the heavens and the earth !

309
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,630
Since you won't let me cultivate

310
00:15:58,800 --> 00:15:59,870
then I will become

311
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:02,350
the supreme ruler among mortals !

312
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,950
If that is what you want,

313
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:05,630
very well.

314
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,870
I don't want things to be handed to me.

315
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,510
I will conquer the world

316
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:11,190
by myself !

317
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:17,750
You've grown up.

318
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,190
Very well.

319
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:27,870
Father,

320
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,070
you can give me everything

321
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,350
so why won't you let me cultivate ?

322
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,190
I am not suited

323
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:37,510
to cultivate the Dao...

324
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:40,230
But I promised you back then

325
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:42,630
that I would stay by your side forever !

326
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,030
Father,

327
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,270
you are too lonely...

328
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:53,510
Protect him

329
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:54,950
on his journey.

330
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:57,830
Ping'er,

331
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:00,750
it's not that I won't let you cultivate.

332
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,630
It's that you can't cultivate.

333
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:07,670
One day, you will understand.

334
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:11,310
But I hope that day

335
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,670
comes as late as possible.

336
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,350
Even

337
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:20,070
that it never comes at all.

338
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:25,870
All members of the Sun Family, listen to me !

339
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,550
Don't step within 1000 zhang of the Wang Mansion !

340
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:29,910
Those who do

341
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:31,190
will be crippled

342
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:32,590
and be expelled from the family !

343
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:38,780
Fa...

344
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:39,470
Family Head,

345
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,550
who is that person ?

346
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,630
Who is he ?

347
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,120
He is someone before whom even our Ancestor

348
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,190
would kneel to and bow with respect.

349
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:50,310
He is the benefactor

350
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,830
our Sun Family owes its situation to !

351
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:55,230
And you dared to provoke him !?

352
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,590
Could it be that person...

353
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,750
Senior Xu Mu ?

354
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,230
You nearly brought a disaster

355
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,630
upon our Sun Family.

356
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:17,510
I will tell this matter

357
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,990
to the Yun Family Head.

358
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:21,310
You

359
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:23,390
should better watch out.

360
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,000
This is all because of you !

361
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:31,430
If you hadn't looked at that boy a few times,

362
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,950
I wouldn't have provoked him !

363
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,390
If it weren't for you,

364
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,190
I wouldn't have offended Xu Mu's son !

365
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:37,630
This is all because of you !

366
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:42,030
Qing Yi,

367
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,230
let's flee.

368
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,630
If the Family Head finds out about this,

369
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:47,070
they will beat me to death !

370
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,560
Now that you've also been expelled from the Sun Family,

371
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,430
your cultivation is sealed

372
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,390
and you're no different from a mortal !

373
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,270
We are a better match now !

374
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:54,670
In this vast world,

375
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:55,910
no one will be able to find us !

376
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,310
Junior Qing Yi

377
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:08,430
pays respects to Senior.

378
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:12,230
Your talent

379
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:13,840
is pretty good.

380
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:17,070
Spend a lifetime with Ping'er

381
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,830
and I'll give you Nascent Soul cultivation.

382
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,910
Are you willing ?

383
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:29,910
I am Wang Ping.

384
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:32,230
Are you also a cultivator ?

385
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:33,870
Junior

386
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,200
is willing.

387
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:48,070
Over 800 years of cultivation

388
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:51,870
and this is the first time I've gotten drunk

389
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,790
on mundane wine...

390
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:56,630
Father,

391
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:58,190
take care.

392
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,990
Is the wine too strong ?

393
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,150
Or is it

394
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,140
that my heart

395
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:14,590
is too heavy ?

396
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:37,670
Karma...

397
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,390
So this is

398
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:45,670
karma ?

399
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:35,040
Go ahead and take a look

400
00:21:30,960 --> 00:21:35,040
on the other side of the mountain.

401
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:41,760
See if the wind is blowing

402
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:41,760
across the sea.

403
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:48,440
A lush tree always grows

404
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:48,440
from a tender shoot.

405
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:56,000
That tree shields you

406
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:56,000
from half of the cold.

407
00:21:56,000 --> 00:22:02,240
The scent of the herbs and the smoke

408
00:21:57,960 --> 00:22:02,240
have drifted away from the stove

409
00:22:02,360 --> 00:22:09,480
whose fire has warmed up

410
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:09,480
half of your lifetime.

411
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:15,240
I watch you smile

412
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:15,240
as you run back to me.

413
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:22,800
That cry, however,

414
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:22,800
came out slowly.

415
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:30,080
I'll take you on a journey through the mortal world,

416
00:22:27,520 --> 00:22:30,080
as autumn fades and spring returns.

417
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:36,920
A few snowflakes have fallen from the eaves,

418
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:36,920
I hope this letter finds you well.

419
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:43,560
I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,

420
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:43,560
having weathered the storms of our journey so far.

421
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:50,280
Looking back, the smell of the food

422
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:50,280
hasn't changed.

423
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:53,640
Take your time.

424
00:22:53,640 --> 00:23:00,840
I’ve walked through this world with you

425
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:00,840
and listened to the joys and sorrows of the mountains.

426
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:07,760
As I count the falling leaves, as spring warms,

427
00:23:03,120 --> 00:23:07,760
another year has flown by.

428
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:14,560
I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,

429
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:14,560
having weathered the storms of our journey so far.

430
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:21,960
Looking back, the smell of the food

431
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:21,960
hasn't changed.

432
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:28,560
Take your time.
